sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(230, 245, 255) Client Side (Browser)
        participant User
        participant CSR as React Components<br/>(useSession, useUserRoles)
    end
    
    box rgb(255, 243, 224) Server Side (NextJS)
        participant MW as Middleware<br/>(middleware.ts)
        participant SSR as Server Components<br/>(page.tsx)
        participant API as API Routes<br/>(/api/verify-token)
        participant NA as NextAuth<br/>(auth.ts)
    end
    
    box rgb(232, 245, 233) External Services
        participant MS as Microsoft Entra ID
        participant Graph as MS Graph API
    end

    %% Initial Request - Server Side Rendering
    User->>CSR: Navigate to /dashboard
    CSR->>MW: GET /dashboard (with cookie)
    
    Note over MW: SERVER: Edge Runtime
    MW->>MW: Check req.auth (decrypt cookie)
    
    alt Not Authenticated
        MW->>CSR: 302 Redirect to /login
        
        Note over CSR: CLIENT: Login Page Rendered
        User->>CSR: Click "Sign In"
        CSR->>NA: GET /api/auth/signin
        
        Note over NA: SERVER: NextAuth Handler
        NA->>CSR: 302 Redirect to Microsoft
        CSR->>MS: Authorization Request (PKCE)
        
        Note over MS: EXTERNAL: User Authentication
        MS->>CSR: Redirect with auth code
        
        CSR->>NA: GET /api/auth/callback/microsoft-entra-id
        Note over NA: SERVER: Token Exchange
        NA->>MS: POST /oauth2/v2.0/token
        MS->>NA: access_token, id_token, refresh_token
        
        Note over NA: SERVER: JWT Callback<br/>Stores tokens in encrypted JWT
        NA->>CSR: Set-Cookie: authjs.session-token
        CSR->>MW: Redirect to /dashboard
    end

    %% Authenticated Request - SSR
    Note over MW: SERVER: Middleware Check
    MW->>MW: Validate session ✓
    MW->>SSR: Allow request
    
    Note over SSR: SERVER: React Server Component
    SSR->>SSR: Render initial HTML
    SSR->>CSR: Send HTML + JS bundle
    
    %% Client Side Hydration & Role Fetching
    Note over CSR: CLIENT: React Hydration
    CSR->>CSR: useSession() - read session
    CSR->>CSR: useUserRoles() - trigger fetch
    
    CSR->>API: GET /api/verify-token
    Note over API: SERVER: API Route Handler
    API->>API: auth() - get session
    API->>API: decodeIdToken() with jose
    
    alt Groups in ID token
        API->>API: checkUserGroups()
    else Groups not in token (fallback)
        API->>Graph: GET /me/memberOf
        Note over Graph: EXTERNAL: Microsoft Graph
        Graph->>API: Group memberships
    end
    
    API->>CSR: { isAdmin, isViewer, groups }
    
    Note over CSR: CLIENT: Update UI based on roles
    CSR->>CSR: Render admin/viewer content
